<div class="divider">✦ ✦ ✦</div>

<section class="wrap narrow reveal">
  <div class="frame">
    <h2>Where This Order Stands</h2>
    <p>That life exists elsewhere we think overwhelmingly likely, on the arithmetic alone. That something
    unexplained appears in the UAP record we accept; that it is a crewed vehicle from another star we do not
    accept, because nobody has shown it. That the encounter tradition is ancient, cross-cultural and
    psychologically real we hold as established — and that its meaning is unsettled we hold as obvious.</p>
    <p>The <em>Law of One</em> is read here attentively and shelved honestly, as the testimony it claims to be
    rather than the data it does not claim to be. If it is right, it will not need us to have overstated it.</p>
    <p>And the thing most worth saying: this is one of very few open questions where an ordinary person may
    live to see an answer. A single atmospheric spectrum could settle the first of our three questions inside
    a decade. Watch that, rather than the lights.</p>
